{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“想有人陪”进一步解释成“孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比X更替人物下结论，削弱了原本的心理开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点放大加亮，让普通观众更快抓住每段心理变化的核心，再通过随乐句出现的感受提示，把人物叙事和实际听到的音乐连接起来。它对音乐的节奏、音色、织体变化和身体反应描述得更具体，也更清楚地串起了从离开后的失落、反复怀念与挣扎，到不再否定过去、带着想念继续生活的全过程。X的左右分栏有直观、简洁的优势，但感受提示与叙事之间的对应关系不如Y清楚，部分心理变化也容易停留在情绪标签层面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6a185a6f-ca2c-4006-9543-b7ad9a9f0a21", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T012119774704Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:22:24.239537+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "624ed6ccf7f7128e0a303d56c943bd2fb4f3ac34a3d6b08964b604c124defe01", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg